    "FLINK-33691": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-33691",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Implemented",
    "title": "Support agg push down for 'count(*)/count(1)/count(column not null)'",
    "description": "Now,  PushLocalAggIntoScanRule cannot push down 'count( * )/count(1)/count(column not null)', but it can push down count(column nullable). The reason is that count( * ) and count( 1 ) will be optimized to a scan with calc as '0 AS $f0' to reduce read cost, which will not match the push down rule",
